\deflang1033\pard\tx360\plain\f2\fs32\b ReportBuilder for Delphi 5
\par Enterprise Edition
\par Release Notes
\par \pard\plain\f2\fs20\b 
\par \plain\f4\fs24 Digital Metaphors
\par 16775 Addison Road, Suite 613
\par Addison, TX 75001
